      "review": {
        "reason": "This hook controls attachment jobs, retained attempt receipts and exact readiness checks for the compose session. Canonical upload and file validation owners are reused. Add/remove/resume states refer to the same local attachment workflow, and there is no parallel Files service. Further extraction needs an independent caller or lifecycle.",
